{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56827","headline":"蒲津朱衣人献范仁恕诗 · 不详","name":"蒲津朱衣人献范仁恕诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栏马遇孙阳，超光力自强。\n北林花正发，西江彩笔香。\n万汇须经手，千年事更长。\n感君施大惠，从此佐五皇。\n（《新编分门古今类事》卷六引《脞说》。\n范仁恕爲前、後蜀时人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}